    "Precision___String_1": {
      "broadcastFacet": true,
      "groups": [],
      "label": "Precision % String",
      "numbers": [],
      "query": "q = load \"NLP_Cases\";\n--Calculate True Positives. This is done by checking if the Case is set to Stop Collection == true, minus the number of False Positives records;\nTP = filter q by ('isStopCollection' == \"true\");\nTP = group TP by isStopCollectionFalsePositive;\nTP = foreach TP generate 'isStopCollectionFalsePositive', count() as 'c';\nTP = foreach TP generate 'isStopCollectionFalsePositive', case when 'isStopCollectionFalsePositive' == \"true\" then -(c) else c end as 'c';\nTP = group TP by isStopCollectionFalsePositive;\nTP = foreach TP generate sum(sum(c)) over([..] partition by all) as 'c';\nFP = filter q by 'isStopCollectionFalsePositive' == \"true\";\nFP = group FP by 'isStopCollectionFalsePositive';\nFP = foreach FP generate isStopCollectionFalsePositive, count() as 'c';\nresult = cogroup TP by all full, FP by all;\nresult = foreach result generate first(TP.c) as 'TP', coalesce(first(FP.c), 0) as 'FP';\nresult = foreach result generate number_to_string(TP/(TP + FP), \"0.00%\") as 'Precision';",
      "receiveFacetSource": { "mode": "all", "steps": [] },
      "selectMode": "single",
      "strings": [],
      "type": "saql",
      "useGlobal": true,
      "visualizationParameters": {
        "parameters": {
          "autoFitMode": "keepLabels",
          "showValues": true,
